WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.020
DEMON TERRITORY

00:05.940 --> 00:09.320
NORTHERN STRONGHOLD

00:22.750 --> 00:24.500
I'm here to report!

00:24.500 --> 00:29.380
The Dark Army is breaching our
defense outposts one by one.

00:29.380 --> 00:32.600
We don't know how long the magical
bulwark can hold them off.

00:33.020 --> 00:35.320
What is the Hero doing?!

00:35.320 --> 00:38.270
He's back to hide
in the Southern Stronghold.

00:38.520 --> 00:40.310
Get him out now!

00:40.310 --> 00:41.130
Yes, Your Majesty!

00:41.130 --> 00:42.480
Your Majesty!

00:43.020 --> 00:47.400
We have to summon all the mages in
the Kingdom and prepare to cast Purification.

00:47.400 --> 00:50.700
But if we use that...

00:50.700 --> 00:52.620
Now that we can't even rely on the Hero,

00:52.620 --> 00:56.080
we won't stand a chance if they break
through the Northern Stronghold.

00:56.460 --> 00:59.080
Your Majesty, please make a decision!

01:13.720 --> 01:25.400
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

02:34.510 --> 02:35.550
O Dark One.

02:35.930 --> 02:39.180
Greanyl, huh?
What's the situation?

02:39.180 --> 02:40.770
I think it's about time.

02:40.770 --> 02:41.970
#5: UNTIL THE END OF MY LIFE

02:41.970 --> 02:43.680
#5: UNTIL THE END OF MY LIFE
Let's retreat, Uliminas.

02:43.680 --> 02:45.770
#5: UNTIL THE END OF MY LIFE
Shouldn't we just keep attacking them?

02:45.770 --> 02:47.440
Shouldn't we just keep attacking them?

02:47.440 --> 02:49.400
They're going to use Purification.

02:49.820 --> 02:51.860
Don't let a single soldier
get caught in it.

02:51.860 --> 02:52.990
Understood!

02:53.610 --> 02:57.660
O holy power, the light of purification.

02:57.660 --> 03:03.160
Cleanse our land and protect us
from the demons.

03:03.160 --> 03:07.170
O holy power, the light of purification.

03:07.170 --> 03:12.420
Cleanse our land and protect us
from the demons.

03:12.420 --> 03:16.630
O holy power, the light of purification.

03:16.630 --> 03:22.430
Cleanse our land and protect us
from the demons!

03:30.820 --> 03:32.280
I'm home.

03:32.640 --> 03:35.150
Welcome home, my dear!

03:36.710 --> 03:38.690
Have you been waiting here
all this time?

03:38.690 --> 03:41.700
I thought it was about time
for you to go home.

03:42.050 --> 03:44.790
Would you like to eat? Take a bath?

03:44.790 --> 03:46.460
Or...

03:46.460 --> 03:47.170
Huh?

03:47.170 --> 03:49.040
Would you want to groom me?

03:49.040 --> 03:52.040
Well, I think I'd like to eat first.

03:52.040 --> 03:55.760
Okay, I'll get it ready right away.

03:59.720 --> 04:02.930
So, how was your trip to town?

04:02.930 --> 04:05.140
Have you found a business partner?

04:05.140 --> 04:06.810
No, not yet.

04:06.810 --> 04:11.810
There are a lot of stores in Houghtow,
so I was just looking around.

04:12.200 --> 04:16.570
I'd like to find out how much
they charge for armor.

04:16.570 --> 04:21.070
Actually, I'm thinking of selling
the vegetables from our fields in town.

04:21.070 --> 04:24.160
We can't keep living here for free,
after all.

04:24.530 --> 04:26.620
There's no need to worry about that.

04:27.060 --> 04:30.210
I'm thinking of breeding horses.

04:30.210 --> 04:31.130
Breeding horses?

04:31.130 --> 04:36.050
I think if I could rent them out,
I would make a good income.

04:36.380 --> 04:39.590
Byleri was a warhorse's caretaker
in the castle.

04:39.590 --> 04:41.550
So she's used to handling horses.

04:41.930 --> 04:43.680
Oh? Is that so?

04:43.680 --> 04:46.390
Then you can use the shed
outside the house.

04:46.770 --> 04:50.350
I'll do my best to support
the household as much as possible.

04:50.350 --> 04:53.150
I can't do anything.

04:53.150 --> 04:54.480
Same here.

04:54.480 --> 04:57.070
And we have no income...

04:57.070 --> 05:01.110
Taking care of you girls
is not a big deal.

05:01.110 --> 05:05.660
As the leader's wife,
it's my duty to take care of my pack.

05:06.410 --> 05:07.160
Pack...

05:07.620 --> 05:10.500
Well, we can share the housework.

05:10.500 --> 05:12.380
Don't worry about the house.

05:12.380 --> 05:14.630
You can focus on swordsmanship and magic.

05:14.630 --> 05:16.630
I... I appreciate it.

05:16.630 --> 05:18.050
Thank you.

05:18.050 --> 05:21.470
Thanks to Purification,
the Dark Army has retreated.

05:22.640 --> 05:26.810
It will take three months
for the spell to wear off.

05:26.810 --> 05:31.270
Until then, their main force won't be
able to approach the purified land.

05:31.730 --> 05:34.110
We can say that we're safe for now.

05:35.690 --> 05:37.730
But the cost of that spell...

05:38.730 --> 05:43.570
The depletion of magic has left
many mages unconscious.

05:43.570 --> 05:48.040
I heard the fastest recovery
would take two to three months.

05:49.890 --> 05:51.540
Including my father.

05:51.950 --> 05:55.210
His Majesty is also
a mage of the Kingdom.

05:55.880 --> 05:58.380
Until my father awakens,

05:58.380 --> 06:02.590
I have to assume his duties
according to Klyrode Law.

06:02.590 --> 06:03.510
Yes, Princess.

06:03.510 --> 06:05.600
This is my first decree.

06:05.600 --> 06:09.220
The Hero is hereby stripped of
his position as the hero of the Kingdom.

06:11.770 --> 06:15.060
He was not helping while
the country was in danger

06:15.060 --> 06:17.250
and even shut himself
in the stronghold.

06:17.250 --> 06:18.730
This is the correct punishment.

06:18.730 --> 06:21.780
Then how do you intend
to deal with the Dark Army?

06:21.780 --> 06:24.910
Do you want to summon
new hero candidates?

06:24.910 --> 06:28.200
No, we don't have enough
mages for summoning.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.040
W-What should we do?

06:31.680 --> 06:33.710
It is true that we are in a deadlock.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.920
Let us consult the Oracle.

06:38.090 --> 06:39.920
Dismissed, you say?

06:40.270 --> 06:42.380
The First Princess has given her orders.

06:42.380 --> 06:44.680
Leave now and go wherever you like.

06:44.680 --> 06:47.890
I am a hero by the King's decree!

06:47.890 --> 06:50.390
Such rudeness should not be tolerated!

06:52.520 --> 06:53.930
Hey, wait!

06:53.930 --> 06:55.690
I forgive you now.

06:55.690 --> 07:00.780
When the Dark One attacks, you will
have no choice but to call me for help!

07:00.780 --> 07:02.650
Damn you mongrels!

07:03.490 --> 07:05.200
Rys, are you already asleep?

07:06.240 --> 07:07.410
Not yet.

07:07.410 --> 07:09.870
I'm still awake, my dear.

07:10.340 --> 07:13.580
You've been working hard
since we moved here.

07:14.750 --> 07:21.050
This Fenrys will do anything for you.

07:21.880 --> 07:25.340
I've been trying to tell you this
for a long time.

07:25.340 --> 07:27.720
I'm grateful to you, Rys.

07:27.720 --> 07:32.430
I know how hard it is for you
to adjust to human life,

07:32.430 --> 07:34.730
but you're even taking care of the house.

07:34.730 --> 07:36.020
I'm really grateful to you—

07:40.820 --> 07:45.860
I was so anxious when I was thrown out
into this world all alone.

07:46.270 --> 07:51.330
Somehow I've managed to survive,
found a job, and got a house to live in.

07:52.080 --> 07:58.330
If I had been alone, I wouldn't have
been able to have a peaceful life like this.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.590
Huh? A date?!

08:01.590 --> 08:08.010
A date is when two humans hang out while
holding hands and flirt together, right?

08:08.390 --> 08:10.890
The weather is so nice today.

08:10.890 --> 08:16.270
Leave the housework to us,
and go somewhere to have fun for today.

08:16.270 --> 08:18.020
Please enjoy yourselves.

08:18.370 --> 08:20.270
Even if you say so...

08:20.690 --> 08:22.230
Why are you embarrassed?

08:22.230 --> 08:23.690
Even though you're married?

08:23.690 --> 08:25.190
Well...

08:25.190 --> 08:27.150
Thank you, girls!

08:27.150 --> 08:30.570
Let's go, my dear! Now!

08:45.340 --> 08:47.380
I'm full.

08:48.010 --> 08:51.340
It was a good decision
to eat here, my dear.

08:51.340 --> 08:52.180
Indeed.

08:52.180 --> 08:54.140
Where shall we go next?

08:55.260 --> 08:58.600
Since Balirossa and others
were so considerate today,

08:58.600 --> 09:03.650
I want to enjoy our time together
to the fullest today.

09:06.400 --> 09:10.490
Wow! There are so many
unusual things here.

09:10.490 --> 09:13.370
That reminds me,
is there anything you want?

09:13.990 --> 09:16.790
You've always helped me,

09:16.790 --> 09:19.790
so I want to give you anything
you like as a thank you.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.500
You want to give something to me?

09:22.540 --> 09:24.460
I'm so happy!

09:24.460 --> 09:27.710
I've never received a gift before.

09:38.680 --> 09:40.640
What's this?

09:40.640 --> 09:43.230
It's a brooch made from
natural gemstone.

09:43.230 --> 09:45.310
It matches your wife's hair color.

09:45.730 --> 09:48.820
Oh my, that's so embarrassing.

09:48.820 --> 09:51.530
It's definitely perfect for you.
What do you think?

09:51.530 --> 09:52.030
Rys.

09:57.090 --> 09:59.000
You're so beautiful, Rys.

09:59.700 --> 10:02.710
I mean, it looks great on you.

10:03.460 --> 10:06.790
Thank you so much, my dear!

10:11.130 --> 10:13.050
What happened?

10:13.050 --> 10:16.260
I don't know. She's been like that
since they came back.

10:16.670 --> 10:21.480
She said that the brooch
was a gift from Sir Flio.

10:21.480 --> 10:22.690
That means...

10:22.980 --> 10:26.230
They enjoyed their date.
That's good to hear.

10:26.230 --> 10:27.900
But still...

10:27.900 --> 10:30.860
I envy them.

10:37.780 --> 10:40.040
My dear...

10:40.040 --> 10:42.250
Rys? W-What are you...?!

10:42.710 --> 10:46.750
Fangs are the most important
part of lupines.

10:51.800 --> 10:55.220
She must be tired because she was
so excited during the day.

11:02.270 --> 11:04.140
I can't sleep like this.

11:13.940 --> 11:15.950
Damn that princess.

11:15.950 --> 11:20.080
She does everything she wants
now that the King is unconscious.

11:20.080 --> 11:25.620
What are you doing from now on, Sir Hero?

11:25.620 --> 11:28.630
Are you going to keep calling me that?

11:28.630 --> 11:35.010
Well, you haven't given up, right?

11:35.010 --> 11:40.600
If you become the hero again, it would
be better to keep accompanying you.

11:41.350 --> 11:42.510
Damn right!

11:42.510 --> 11:47.690
I'm not planning to be
some commoner in this world.

11:48.050 --> 11:52.270
There has to be some treasure that can
deal with the Dark One in this treasury.

11:52.690 --> 11:58.360
I'll use that to beat the Dark One
and live my life as the hero again.

11:58.360 --> 12:00.990
I'm the one who was chosen
to be the hero.

12:00.990 --> 12:06.620
How can that guy use magic I can't use?

12:07.250 --> 12:10.250
If only I have powers too...

12:11.420 --> 12:13.840
Is it power you seek?

12:13.840 --> 12:15.010
Who's there?!

12:15.010 --> 12:16.670
Sir Hero?

12:16.670 --> 12:20.550
If it's power you're after,
then release me.

12:23.010 --> 12:25.220
W-What do you mean?

12:25.220 --> 12:26.350
Come here.

12:36.530 --> 12:39.570
Now, draw this sword.

12:39.570 --> 12:42.620
I will fulfill any of your wishes.

12:42.620 --> 12:46.080
Anything? Are you sure?

12:46.080 --> 12:51.210
Sir Hero?
Who are you talking to?

12:51.210 --> 12:53.460
You don't hear that voice?

12:53.460 --> 12:54.250
Yes.

12:54.600 --> 12:57.420
Now, draw the sword.

12:57.420 --> 13:00.010
What's wrong?
Are you scared?

13:00.010 --> 13:01.680
As if!

13:01.680 --> 13:02.970
Gulp...

13:04.680 --> 13:09.020
Whatever you are,
I'll make use of it!

13:22.740 --> 13:24.660
I am Hiya.

13:24.660 --> 13:28.250
The djinn who commands
primordial light and darkness.

13:28.660 --> 13:33.380
Was it you who released me
from the seal?

13:35.710 --> 13:39.210
Was it you who released me
from the seal?

13:39.800 --> 13:42.510
Her voice is resounding directly
inside my head.

13:48.100 --> 13:50.560
That's right.

13:50.560 --> 13:53.520
I'm the hero who released you.

13:53.520 --> 13:57.480
In that case,
I shall grant you three wishes.

13:58.280 --> 14:01.070
Anything, right?

14:02.280 --> 14:05.660
Sure, whatever you desire.

14:06.010 --> 14:08.240
Then, my first wish is...

14:11.330 --> 14:14.590
Thank you for coming here,
Oracle Ursula.

14:15.250 --> 14:20.840
What kind of troubles make a princess from
the strongest Magical Kingdom seek me?

14:20.840 --> 14:22.970
It must be serious.

14:23.380 --> 14:28.100
The only thing protecting
this Kingdom is Purification.

14:28.490 --> 14:31.850
We must find our next move
before the spell wears off.

14:31.850 --> 14:35.650
So you want to know that?

14:35.650 --> 14:36.730
Yes.

14:36.730 --> 14:40.770
Whatever it is, if it can save
this kingdom, please tell us!

14:40.770 --> 14:43.110
If you could see something,
it would be a great help.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.990
What is this?

14:50.990 --> 14:52.540
It won't come off!

14:55.710 --> 14:59.340
Head to the underground treasury now!
Find the invaders who did this!

14:59.340 --> 14:59.800
Yes!

15:04.050 --> 15:05.380
What is this thing?

15:05.380 --> 15:07.680
The Collar of Sacrifice.

15:08.100 --> 15:14.890
In exchange for granting wishes, a certain
djinn uses this to behead offered victims.

15:14.890 --> 15:16.850
- What?!
- No way!

15:16.850 --> 15:19.360
Why are they targeting us?

15:19.360 --> 15:25.080
Long ago, a King of Klyrode wished
for the death of the Dark One.

15:25.770 --> 15:31.660
I heard half of the lives on this continent
became a price for that wish.

15:32.450 --> 15:35.580
After that, the djinn was sealed,

15:35.580 --> 15:40.750
and it took nearly all the mages
in the kingdom to do it.

15:41.170 --> 15:44.880
And now someone released the seal
that could not be easily undone,

15:44.880 --> 15:47.590
and wished something to that djinn.

15:47.590 --> 15:49.800
Does that mean our heads will...

15:51.260 --> 15:54.770
The price will be paid until
the wish is fully granted.

15:55.270 --> 15:56.730
Oracle Ursula.

15:56.730 --> 16:01.110
Please tell me what I must do
to overcome this danger.

16:09.820 --> 16:12.450
You must find the true hero.

16:12.450 --> 16:15.540
That person is already been summoned.

16:16.500 --> 16:21.000
I'm sure it's the adventurer who doesn't
want to work under His Majesty!

16:21.000 --> 16:23.880
Indeed! It must be Sir Flio!

16:25.510 --> 16:28.430
That person is in the west
of this kingdom.

16:28.430 --> 16:32.640
Rally the soldiers and search
every town and village there!

16:33.140 --> 16:34.220
No.

16:34.220 --> 16:38.350
We can't deploy the forces
that are protecting us here.

16:39.270 --> 16:41.560
I shall go directly at him.

16:43.480 --> 16:45.070
This is amazing.

16:45.070 --> 16:48.280
This shield must be made
from dragon scales.

16:48.730 --> 16:51.160
You have a good eye, Sir.

16:51.160 --> 16:53.580
I made the right choice by coming here.

16:54.490 --> 17:00.750
I hear the local butcher got a large bunch
of dragon meat not too long ago.

17:01.200 --> 17:02.790
Was that you as well?

17:02.790 --> 17:06.340
I happened to have a chance
to get it through a friend.

17:06.340 --> 17:10.220
That shield is also a top-quality product
that came from that secret route.

17:11.750 --> 17:15.890
I understand.
Give me your price for this.

17:15.890 --> 17:21.810
But next time bring some products
from that secret route to me again.

17:21.810 --> 17:23.060
I don't mind.

17:23.060 --> 17:27.030
Then, I will bring you
the rest of the armor.

17:27.030 --> 17:30.490
As for the other items,
like the skins of magic beasts...

17:30.490 --> 17:33.870
Do you know who would be interested?

17:33.870 --> 17:37.450
I have recently moved to this area,

17:37.450 --> 17:41.500
and I'm looking for regular partners
to distribute the goods I procure.

17:41.920 --> 17:47.500
It would be very reassuring to have
the help of a trusted store owner.

17:48.670 --> 17:50.720
Honestly, I want to take it all, but...

17:50.720 --> 17:53.090
Fine, I will introduce you to someone.

17:53.090 --> 17:55.430
I look forward to working with you, Sir.

17:56.390 --> 17:59.560
Sir Flio is truly a man with many talents.

17:59.560 --> 18:03.020
Not only did he create a magnificent shield
out of dragon material,

18:03.020 --> 18:07.520
but he also negotiated its purchase
and secured the trade route all by himself.

18:07.870 --> 18:11.360
He told me that he used
to be a merchant.

18:11.360 --> 18:15.450
He must have been a big player
in his former place.

18:18.790 --> 18:22.120
I envy you for having him as your husb—

18:22.120 --> 18:23.080
Don't think about it.

18:23.080 --> 18:27.420
I mean, I wish I had someone like him...

18:27.420 --> 18:31.510
But you have a capable suitor already, right?

18:31.510 --> 18:32.800
Ghozal, I mean.

18:33.430 --> 18:36.640
He seemed to like you a lot.

18:36.640 --> 18:40.890
He likes me?
The Dark One likes me?

18:40.890 --> 18:42.640
Sorry to keep you two waiting.

18:43.140 --> 18:46.310
It seems you have sold the dragon shield.

18:46.310 --> 18:49.330
Yeah, it sold for more than I expected.

18:49.830 --> 18:52.240
Thank you for introducing me
to a great store,

18:52.630 --> 18:53.650
Balirossa.

18:54.910 --> 18:58.450
I used to come here
when I was a knight before.

18:58.450 --> 19:01.700
I'm just glad to be of use.

19:01.700 --> 19:03.210
Shall we go home then?

19:03.210 --> 19:04.290
Yes.

19:04.870 --> 19:08.880
You sure seem to enjoy doing business.

19:08.880 --> 19:10.380
Is that so?

19:10.380 --> 19:15.800
I used to be a merchant,
I guess this kind of work suits me.

19:15.800 --> 19:16.720
However...

19:18.320 --> 19:22.930
It's good to see you working like this,

19:23.810 --> 19:28.020
but I'm going to miss our time together.

19:31.900 --> 19:37.950
I want to hunt or hang out together
like the other day once in a while.

19:37.950 --> 19:39.910
Would you?

19:39.910 --> 19:41.120
Sure.

19:43.580 --> 19:45.160
That's a promise, okay?

19:45.160 --> 19:48.130
Caution: A djinn is approaching.

19:48.500 --> 19:49.630
A djinn?

19:51.420 --> 19:53.800
Who are you, woman?

19:53.800 --> 19:56.010
I am Djinn Hiya.

19:56.010 --> 19:57.800
You are Flio, right?

19:59.220 --> 20:01.010
What can I do for you?

20:03.770 --> 20:05.810
My first wish is...

20:05.810 --> 20:11.230
Kill Flio, the criminal
who has humiliated me!

20:11.730 --> 20:13.690
Executing wish.

20:13.690 --> 20:14.530
My dear!

20:14.530 --> 20:16.820
Auto-casting defensive magic.

20:26.620 --> 20:28.620
Rys...?

20:30.830 --> 20:35.380
My dear, please run...

20:37.010 --> 20:38.720
Lady Rys!

20:39.550 --> 20:42.050
Oh my, I missed my attack.

20:42.050 --> 20:44.260
How dare you hurt Lady Rys!

20:49.850 --> 20:51.230
Rys!

20:51.690 --> 20:53.190
Rys!

20:53.690 --> 20:57.690
It looks like average offensive magic
won't deal anything to him.

20:58.570 --> 20:59.400
Then...

20:59.400 --> 21:01.740
Sir Flio, use your spell!

21:02.110 --> 21:03.530
Heal!

21:05.450 --> 21:07.540
My spell doesn't work?!

21:07.970 --> 21:11.330
The injury is too severe to be healed.

21:11.330 --> 21:12.790
Do I have any other spell?

21:12.790 --> 21:16.130
There's no substitute for a healing spell.

21:16.880 --> 21:17.880
Why...

21:27.270 --> 21:28.390
Rys!

21:30.600 --> 21:33.100
Primordial Light.

21:44.280 --> 21:46.200
Even this can't scratch him?

21:46.870 --> 21:50.250
You have mastered
Primordial Light and Dark spells.

21:52.210 --> 21:53.750
I won't forgive you.

21:55.540 --> 21:57.250
Sir Flio?

22:04.340 --> 22:08.060
You are the only one
I won't forgive!

23:41.480 --> 23:44.150
My dear in battle mode is so cool.

23:44.150 --> 23:47.280
Lady Rys, I don't think this is
the time to be talking like that.

23:47.750 --> 23:50.120
I can't get enough of
that sharp look in his eyes.

23:50.120 --> 23:52.330
No, I have to be firm.

23:52.330 --> 23:54.660
Next episode:
"Hiya the Djinn of Light and Darkness"

23:54.660 --> 23:56.160
Lady Rys, be careful!

23:56.160 --> 23:58.040
I don't care if I die already.

23:58.040 --> 23:59.690
No! You can't!
